WEBVTT

00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:43.120
Hunters: brave travelers
who hunt monsters

00:01:43.120 --> 00:01:46.380
with their trusty
cait sith by their sides.

00:01:46.380 --> 00:01:50.920
Hunter Huey pursues
one quarry in particular,

00:01:50.920 --> 00:01:54.300
one he stumbled upon by sheer chance...

00:01:57.140 --> 00:01:57.810
Me?

00:01:57.810 --> 00:02:00.180
The Red Dragon!

00:01:57.880 --> 00:02:01.180
