00:13:29.710 --> 00:13:30.910
All in one glorious bath!

00:13:30.910 --> 00:13:32.210
That was all just describing a bath?!

00:13:32.210 --> 00:13:34.040
A simple one, yes.

00:13:34.040 --> 00:13:39.550
I see. A property for laying low
with a private bath attached.

00:13:39.550 --> 00:13:40.630
How about...

00:13:48.140 --> 00:13:50.310
It's just a cave, is it not?

00:13:50.310 --> 00:13:52.480
While it might appear to be a mere cave,

00:13:52.480 --> 00:13:55.020
inside, it houses a
four-bedroom residence.

00:13:55.020 --> 00:13:57.610
W-Wow!

00:13:57.610 --> 00:14:01.700
No one would ever come
looking for me here, of all places.

00:14:01.700 --> 00:14:03.490
Also, one question...

00:14:03.490 --> 00:14:05.990
Why are you coming with us, too?!

00:14:05.990 --> 00:14:10.080
Dearia's helping me find a house, too!

00:14:10.080 --> 00:14:12.120
A dragon going house-hunting?

00:14:12.120 --> 00:14:15.710
Why? Do you need a castle
for your hoard of gold?

00:14:15.710 --> 00:14:18.000
I-It's none of your business!

00:14:18.000 --> 00:14:22.800
Well, I suppose I could let you stay
with me if you became my retainer.

00:14:22.800 --> 00:14:23.840
No, thanks!

00:14:23.840 --> 00:14:27.930
Right then, I'll bill the agency fees and
property cost to your retainer: Letty.

00:14:27.930 --> 00:14:29.640
Oh, come on!

00:14:31.850 --> 00:14:33.020
I'm too big.

00:14:33.020 --> 00:14:34.900
What would you like to look at first?

00:14:34.900 --> 00:14:38.150
The bath, of course! I'd like
to wash myself clean right away!

00:14:42.780 --> 00:14:44.950
This is the bath. Do enjoy.

00:14:44.950 --> 00:14:45.950
What?

00:14:45.950 --> 00:14:48.700
You dare call that leaky faucet a bath?!

00:14:48.700 --> 00:14:51.330
No need for rude language. This is
a free-flowing cold mineral spring.

00:14:51.330 --> 00:14:55.420
Its sulfiric content can treat athlete's
foot, rheumatism, and nerve pain.

00:14:55.420 --> 00:14:58.380
I'm not afflicted by any of those!

00:14:58.380 --> 00:15:02.130
A bath must have enough
water flow to fill a bathtub!

00:15:02.130 --> 00:15:06.090
Not to mention fragrant bath salts,
soaps, and perfumed oils!

00:15:06.090 --> 00:15:07.680
Boy, you sure are spoiled.

00:15:07.680 --> 00:15:08.760
Quiet, drummox.

00:15:08.760 --> 00:15:10.560
Drummox?! What's a drummox?!

00:15:10.560 --> 00:15:13.140
A cross between a dragon
and a lummox, stupid!

00:15:13.140 --> 00:15:14.770
We need more water!

00:15:17.690 --> 00:15:19.270
Will this suffice?

00:15:19.270 --> 00:15:20.690
Suffice <i>how</i>?

00:15:20.690 --> 00:15:25.070
The basin beneath the water is
ten meters deep. A spacious tub, indeed.

00:15:25.070 --> 00:15:27.280
Surely this is enough water.

00:15:27.280 --> 00:15:30.200
That was not what I meant!

00:15:30.200 --> 00:15:33.250
A waterfall is hardly a bath!

00:15:33.250 --> 00:15:35.960
The living space is just
behind the waterfall here.

00:15:35.960 --> 00:15:37.750
I'm speaking!

00:15:37.750 --> 00:15:39.420
It comes with a sauna as well.

00:15:39.420 --> 00:15:43.420
When you're finished there,
you can dive straight into the basin.

00:15:43.420 --> 00:15:44.550
I think not!

00:15:44.550 --> 00:15:48.180
How difficult is it to find
a proper bath?!

00:15:48.180 --> 00:15:51.390
Do you even know what a bath is,

00:15:51.390 --> 00:15:52.770
or do I need to teach--

00:15:55.480 --> 00:15:56.480
Watch out!

00:16:01.690 --> 00:16:02.440
"Huh?"

00:16:02.560 --> 00:16:04.860
WAUGH!

00:16:02.780 --> 00:16:05.280
Some help you are! Now we're both falling!

00:16:05.280 --> 00:16:06.650
I'm sorry!

00:16:06.650 --> 00:16:11.240
Jumping in already? How impatient.

00:16:12.280 --> 00:16:13.620
Now see here, Elf...

00:16:13.620 --> 00:16:17.660
Since you seem ignorant to the concept,

00:16:17.660 --> 00:16:21.420
let me inform you that baths are
supposed to be hot. Toasty warm!

00:16:21.420 --> 00:16:22.920
Understood.

00:16:25.010 --> 00:16:25.920
Is this hot enough?

00:16:25.920 --> 00:16:27.930
Hot!

00:16:27.930 --> 00:16:31.350
The water temperature in this salt spring
can rise to 120 degrees Celsius.

00:16:31.350 --> 00:16:33.140
This is too hot!

00:16:33.140 --> 00:16:36.680
The living space is inside the volcano,
next to the magma chamber.

00:16:35.010 --> 00:16:35.760
UP HERE

00:16:36.510 --> 00:16:37.260
UP HERE

00:16:36.680 --> 00:16:39.520
So I can burn to death
in my sleep, you dimwit!

00:16:38.010 --> 00:16:38.970
UP HERE

00:16:39.520 --> 00:16:42.690
Pip is waiting it out in an icebox.

00:16:48.450 --> 00:16:51.410
I've been dragged all over, and for what?

00:16:51.410 --> 00:16:54.200
To be prepared like stew
in a dragon's cooking pot.

00:16:54.200 --> 00:16:57.700
I'm trying to help!
You could be a little nicer!

00:16:57.700 --> 00:17:02.040
I'm only doing this because
you said you wanted a bath!

00:17:02.040 --> 00:17:04.210
But why must I bathe in your cookpot?

00:17:04.210 --> 00:17:07.710
What else were we going to use?!

00:17:07.710 --> 00:17:11.840
I'll leave the water here so
you can make it hotter if you want.

00:17:13.140 --> 00:17:14.010
Don't peek.

00:17:14.010 --> 00:17:15.760
Why would I?!

00:17:15.760 --> 00:17:18.270
I'm gonna stay here, though, just in case!

00:17:26.820 --> 00:17:30.610
If you have something to say,
then out with it.

00:17:30.610 --> 00:17:37.240
So, uh, why did you want to run away
from home in the first place?

00:17:37.240 --> 00:17:39.370
That's none of your business.

00:17:39.370 --> 00:17:41.620
Well, sure,

00:17:41.620 --> 00:17:44.380
but I'll hear you out if you want.

00:17:49.010 --> 00:17:52.130
My father ate my cupcake
without asking me first.

00:17:52.130 --> 00:17:53.840
That's it?!

00:17:53.840 --> 00:17:56.350
Maybe you should just forgive him?

00:17:56.350 --> 00:17:58.520
Why should I?

00:17:58.520 --> 00:18:01.980
He needs to reflect on what
he's done, the big buffoon!

00:18:01.980 --> 00:18:04.900
I get holding grudges
over food, but sheesh...

00:18:04.900 --> 00:18:07.980
Still, it's dangerous for
young girls to travel alone.

00:18:07.980 --> 00:18:10.190
I mean, you already got kidnapped once.

00:18:10.190 --> 00:18:12.910
I-I just let my guard down, that's all!

00:18:12.910 --> 00:18:15.450
If Dearia hadn't been there to help,
you might've been in worse trouble.

00:18:15.450 --> 00:18:18.240
Yes, I'm quite aware!

00:18:18.240 --> 00:18:21.290
I know I'm well within your debt.

00:18:21.290 --> 00:18:24.420
So I'll state it formally.

00:18:26.210 --> 00:18:31.260
Th-Thank you for saving me.

00:18:33.010 --> 00:18:37.810
You may be a bit of a halfwit,
but you are a kind dragon.

00:18:37.810 --> 00:18:40.720
I'm glad it was you who found me.

00:18:43.940 --> 00:18:45.020
Can I hear that again?

00:18:45.020 --> 00:18:47.190
Absolutely not! And don't look at me!

00:18:47.190 --> 00:18:49.400
Where is that elf, by the way?

00:18:49.400 --> 00:18:53.070
I think he said he was going on a walk.

00:18:53.070 --> 00:18:55.410
Oh, there he comes now!

00:18:55.410 --> 00:18:58.530
Excellent. Let us make camp
here for the night.

00:19:03.210 --> 00:19:05.290
The Flame Dragon Lord! Why are you here?!

00:19:05.290 --> 00:19:06.790
Look, long story...

00:19:06.790 --> 00:19:10.210
The Flame Dragon Lord?!
The one pursuing world domination?!

00:19:10.210 --> 00:19:12.090
It's just a rumor, nothing more.

00:19:12.090 --> 00:19:14.800
Hey! Isn't that the princess?!

00:19:14.800 --> 00:19:15.880
What?!

00:19:18.680 --> 00:19:22.270
Then it was you who kidnapped
the princess, Flame Dragon Lord!

00:19:22.270 --> 00:19:22.890
Huh?!

00:19:22.890 --> 00:19:24.810
And you're cooking her into a stew?!

00:19:24.810 --> 00:19:26.560
I'm not! She--

00:19:26.560 --> 00:19:28.150
Wait, you're a princess?!

00:19:28.150 --> 00:19:29.650
I told you my name and title when we met!

00:19:29.650 --> 00:19:31.650
How was I supposed to remember all that?!

00:19:31.650 --> 00:19:33.860
Fear not, Princess! We will save you!

00:19:33.860 --> 00:19:35.610
Ugh, they're so persistent!

00:19:35.610 --> 00:19:38.160
No matter where I go, they follow
after me, like some kind of stalker!

00:19:38.160 --> 00:19:40.080
Princess! Oh, Princess!

00:19:40.080 --> 00:19:43.000
That's why you're trying to lie low.

00:19:43.000 --> 00:19:47.120
I haven't been kidnapped!
I left home by my own will!

00:19:47.120 --> 00:19:48.170
What?

00:19:48.170 --> 00:19:50.290
So kindly make like a tree
and leave, you horrible stalkers!

