00:19:55.380 --> 00:19:58.510
You self-centered narcissists!

00:19:55.710 --> 00:19:57.500
"narcissists"                         "numbskulls"

00:19:58.510 --> 00:20:00.600
Maybe go easy on them.

00:20:00.600 --> 00:20:04.730
You villain! You've brainwashed
the poor princess!

00:20:04.730 --> 00:20:06.640
Dispel your charms at once!

00:20:06.640 --> 00:20:08.190
Seriously?!

00:20:08.190 --> 00:20:09.520
Uh...

00:20:12.940 --> 00:20:15.240
I won't let you have her!

00:20:16.360 --> 00:20:17.740
You'd really...

00:20:17.740 --> 00:20:19.620
Prepare to die, Flame Dragon Lord!

00:20:19.620 --> 00:20:22.080
We're stronger than we were before!

00:20:22.080 --> 00:20:23.950
Oh, jeez, oh, jeez!

00:20:23.950 --> 00:20:26.620
You'll pay for stealing our gear...

00:20:26.620 --> 00:20:29.080
Right here, right now!

00:20:29.080 --> 00:20:33.460
"aaaaaugh!"

00:20:34.000 --> 00:20:38.340
First the bandits, now these creatures...
how terribly misfortunate we've been.

00:20:38.340 --> 00:20:40.640
Dearia! Did... Did you just--

00:20:40.640 --> 00:20:44.850
It was just a simple spell.
They're quite capable of surviving it.

00:20:44.850 --> 00:20:46.060
They are Heroes, after all.

00:20:46.060 --> 00:20:48.890
What are these Heroes made of?!

00:20:48.890 --> 00:20:53.940
So, what does the Great Flame
Dragon Lord intend to do with me?

00:20:53.940 --> 00:20:58.860
Nothing. Also, could you
please not call me that?

00:20:58.860 --> 00:21:05.240
I still think you should go home,
but I don't wanna force you.

00:21:05.240 --> 00:21:09.120
But I'd be worried about
you traveling all on your own.

00:21:09.120 --> 00:21:12.840
So until you decide you want to go home,

00:21:12.840 --> 00:21:14.750
you can travel with us if you want.

00:21:18.050 --> 00:21:21.220
You want me to come
house-hunting with you?

00:21:21.220 --> 00:21:22.550
Is that a no?

00:21:22.550 --> 00:21:24.640
N-Not exactly.

00:21:24.640 --> 00:21:27.980
You did protect me from those Heroes.

00:21:27.980 --> 00:21:32.980
If you insist, then I suppose
I must come along.

00:21:32.980 --> 00:21:36.230
Here, have some soup, uh...
what's your name again?

00:21:36.230 --> 00:21:38.030
You may call me Nell.

00:21:39.360 --> 00:21:42.740
Glad to have you with us, Nell!

00:21:42.740 --> 00:21:44.700
Likewise!

00:21:44.700 --> 00:21:47.410
The princess and her knight.

00:21:48.540 --> 00:21:51.370
This is horrible!
It's blander than water itself!

00:21:51.370 --> 00:21:55.170
If you don't like it, then don't eat it!

00:21:55.170 --> 00:21:57.210
Or perhaps a wife and her mother-in-law.

